# Conventional Commits enforcement (Blueprint §13.4)
#
# A greppable history is disproportionately valuable for a two-person team where
# losing shared context is the real long-term risk (Blueprint §14.2).
#
# Format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# Example: feat(garden): derive weekly counts from source logs
#
# Allowed scopes are listed in commitlint.config.js.

npx --no-install commitlint --edit "$1"
